Step 2: Implement SetFailureReason in RedisJobStore

In `core/infra/memory/job_store.go`, add:
```go
func (s *RedisJobStore) SetFailureReason(ctx context.Context, jobID, reason string) error {
    key := s.jobKey(jobID)
    return s.rdb.HSet(ctx, key, "failure_reason", reason).Err()
}
```
Also update `GetJobRecord` (or equivalent) to read the field back.
